  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Logistics Capability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Humanitarian Logistics Capability investment facilitates the timely and effective delivery of Australian Government humanitarian assistance through the provision of appropriate and high-quality humanitarian supply chain logistics support. This investment is a flexible, responsive mechanism that provides partner governments and humanitarian partners with timely, appropriate, and complementary humanitarian supplies and logistics to prepare for and respond to crises.
The end-of-investment outcomes are: 1. The Australian Government has an effective logistics capability to respond in a timely, relevant, and appropriate manner to humanitarian emergencies and disasters overseas. 2. The Australian Government&#x2019;s humanitarian emergency and disaster response overseas includes the provision of relevant and appropriate supplies for &#x2018;at risk&#x2019; groups.? 
This investment works with other Australian humanitarian programs, including deployable capabilities and NGO partnerships.</narrative>
  </description>
